{
  "sourceLanguage": "fr",
  "strings": {
    "Abonnements": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subscriptions"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suscripciones"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accepter": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accept"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aceptar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Achetés une fois, utilisés quand vous voulez. Ils ne se périment pas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bought once, used whenever you like. They don't expire."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprados una vez, usados cuando quieras. No caducan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Affiché sur vos plans, et utilisé par les critères des autres.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shown on your plans, and used by other people's filters."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se muestra en tus planes, y lo usan los criterios de los demás."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Annuler": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancelar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Annuler ce plan": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel this plan"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancelar este plan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Au-delà d'une, il faut les plans de groupe — compris à partir d'Escapade, ou à l'unité avec une « Tablée ».": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beyond one, you need group plans — included from Escapade upwards, or singly with a Tablée."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Más de una requiere planes de grupo — incluidos a partir de Escapade, o por unidades con una Tablée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aucun plan publié": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No plans posted"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ningún plan publicado"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aucun plan à venir": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No upcoming plans"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ningún plan próximo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Autour": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nearby"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cerca"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Autour de vous": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Around you"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A tu alrededor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bilan": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bilan"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bilan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bloc au mur de 19 h, niveau débutant": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bouldering at the 7pm wall, beginners welcome"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bloque en el muro de las 19 h, nivel principiante"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bloquer": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Block"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bloquear"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bornées à toutes les offres, socle gratuit compris. Elles reviennent à minuit. C'est ce qui empêche d'arroser — sur Weave, une demande vaut quelque chose.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capped on every plan, the free tier included. They come back at midnight. That's what stops people spraying requests — on Weave, asking costs you something."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limitadas en todas las suscripciones, incluida la gratuita. Vuelven a medianoche. Es lo que impide lanzar la caña a todo el mundo — en Weave, pedir vale algo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "C'est le moment de publier quelque chose. Un plan sans réponse reste un plan : vous ferez ce que vous aviez prévu.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Now's the time to post something. A plan with no replies is still a plan: you'll do what you were going to do."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es el momento de publicar algo. Un plan sin respuestas sigue siendo un plan: harás lo que tenías previsto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ce critère peut révéler votre orientation sexuelle. La loi le range à part : il demande votre accord explicite, que vous pouvez retirer quand vous voulez.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This filter can reveal your sexual orientation. The law treats it separately: it needs your explicit consent, which you can withdraw whenever you like."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este criterio puede revelar tu orientación sexual. La ley lo trata aparte: necesita tu consentimiento explícito, que puedes retirar cuando quieras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ce plan est complet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That plan is full."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese plan está completo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ce que vous faites": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you're doing"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo que haces"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ce qui attire": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What draws people"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo que atrae"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ce qui attire, ce qui tombe à plat, sur vos plans passés. Rien n'est comparé aux autres, et les messages reçus ne sont pas lus.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What draws people and what falls flat, across your past plans. Nothing is compared with anyone else's, and the messages you received are not read."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo que atrae y lo que no cuaja, en tus planes pasados. Nada se compara con los demás, y los mensajes recibidos no se leen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ce qui tombe à plat": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What falls flat"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo que no cuaja"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cette demande consomme une de vos demandes du jour. Retirée avant d'avoir été lue, elle vous est rendue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This uses one of today's requests. Withdrawn before it's read, it's given back to you."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto consume una de tus peticiones de hoy. Retirada antes de ser leída, se te devuelve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changer d'adresse": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change address"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cambiar de dirección"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Combien de personnes peuvent venir": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How many people can come"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuántas personas pueden venir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Combien de temps à l'avance vos plans étaient publiés. À vous d'en tirer ce que vous voulez.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How far ahead your plans went up. Make of it what you like."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con cuánta antelación se publicaron tus planes. Saca de ello lo que quieras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confidentialité": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privacy"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privacidad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Critères du fil": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Feed filters"
